WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:03.000
I’m Vincent, and I built Synapses.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:07.960
On LinkedIn, you have hundreds of contacts, and no big picture.

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:13.360
Just an endless list. Who do you know, and where? Impossible to tell.

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:16.120
Synapses turns it into a map.

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:20.520
Drop your LinkedIn export, and your network appears.

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:26.520
Group it by industry, company, function or seniority.

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:32.200
One click on an industry: the people closest to you first.

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:38.920
Got a company in mind? Synapses shows you who can open the door.

00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:44.120
And you finally see where your network clusters.

00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:50.440
Everything happens in your browser: your file never leaves it.

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:56.280
Synapses. Free, no sign-up. Try it on your own network.
